<title>IRAN: Iran navy rescues crew of sinking UAE boat.</title>
<headline>Iran navy rescues crew of sinking UAE boat.</headline>
<dateline>TEHRAN 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Iranian navy rescued all five crew members of a small United Arab Emirates cargo vessel that ran aground in the Gulf, Iran's news agency IRNA said on Thursday.</p>
<p>It quoted a military statement as saying navy units rushed to an area off Iran's Sirri Island after the boat from the UAE emirate of Sharjah, 110 km (69 miles) to the east, hit a rock and sank with its cargo of livestocks and poultry.</p>
<p>It did not give the date of the accident.</p>
</text>
